WEBVTT

00:00:08,910 --> 00:00:15,230
Is it okay to take diatomaceous earth food grade for extra cleansing if you have breast cancer?

00:00:16,590 --> 00:00:20,670
General answer to that is yes, it is. If you haven't started it, now

00:00:21,790 --> 00:00:27,070
the only recommendation of that is to start at a lower dose. Start maybe a teaspoon a day

00:00:27,070 --> 00:00:31,710
for a period of time and you can work up to maybe a tablespoon a day or something.

00:00:33,470 --> 00:00:38,430
But no, there's no really negatives to that. Diatomaceous earth is really a binder

00:00:39,630 --> 00:00:45,150
more than anything else. It can help sweep the gut similar to SBI Pro,

00:00:46,750 --> 00:00:50,750
but Mudo-Globe let's help decrease the inflammation probably a little better

00:00:50,750 --> 00:00:55,950
than diatomaceous earth. But diatomaceous earth acts more as a binder in the gut, which is good.

00:00:55,950 --> 00:01:05,550
It's fine, that's it can be an anti-parasite in the gut as well. So yeah, it can be a good thing to do.

00:01:05,550 --> 00:01:10,750
There's no downsides to that. Some people can have sensitivities to it.

00:01:12,270 --> 00:01:17,550
Maybe it just doesn't do well with them, and I don't think it's like an antibody sensitivity,

00:01:17,550 --> 00:01:22,270
but I think it just is an irritant. So just I would start slow with it.

